%% Money flow for one pool receivable (design, Tranche 2). Circle USDC is the USD rail; nothing is bridged.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Inv as Investor (legal entity)
  participant PC as Pool contract (Stellar)
  participant Koy as Koywe
  actor Exp as Exporter
  actor Buy as Buyer
  participant Br as Bridge
  participant Col as Collection account

  Inv->>PC: subscribe: Circle USDC on Stellar
  PC-->>Inv: pool shares minted in the same transaction
  Note over PC: TruMarket attests the receivable (attest)
  PC->>Koy: release: 90% of face in USDC to the payout account
  Koy->>Exp: USDC to PEN or CLP, paid locally
  Note over Exp,Buy: Goods shipped, buyer pays at term
  Buy->>Br: USD to the buyer's virtual account
  Br->>Col: USD to USDC on Stellar (memo matched)
  Br-->>PC: HMAC-signed webhook, then settle
  Col->>PC: settle: principal, investor amount, balance
  PC->>Inv: distribute monthly, pro rata
  Inv->>PC: redeem at the 3-month term
  PC-->>Inv: USDC at NAV, shares burned
